      "note": "The id only picks a file the viewer may see (policy_scope); it never reaches the path. Upload#path is Uploads::Storage.path(key), under storage/files, and the key is a UUID the app made (Upload before_validation), never typed by anyone. The name only goes in the Content-Disposition header, cleaned by Uploads::Filename."
